{"format":1,"id":"2026-11-16","kind":"agoranome.x402-sheet","licence":"CC BY 4.0","method":["Who is on the sheet: every listing in Coinbase's x402 Bazaar index with 3 or more unique payers in 30 days on the day of the run (real demand). The index is the list of where to look; every verdict comes from the seller's own endpoint.","How each listing is asked: an unpaid GET, then an empty JSON POST if the GET did not answer 402, from a public address, following no redirect. A listing that gives no payable offer is asked once more a few seconds later and the second answer is kept. Nothing is ever paid.","answer: payable when the endpoint answered 402 with at least one payment option naming a network, an asset, an amount and a pay-to address (the x402 v2 PAYMENT-REQUIRED header or the v1 body); unreadable_offer for a 402 without one; no_payment_asked for a 2xx; gone for 404 or 410; http_4xx and http_5xx for other errors; unreachable when no HTTP answer came; declined when the URL is not public https, so it was not asked; not_asked when the run reached its per-host cap or time budget before asking it; other for anything else.","price: of the listing's options, those offered live on the same network and asset are compared, each with the cheapest live option on that network and asset. above_listed when any asks more than listed; else below_listed when any asks less; else as_listed. listed_option_missing when no listed option is offered live on its network and asset; not_listed when the listing states no usable price.","pay_to: as_listed when every compared listed option with a pay-to address is offered live paying that address; different when any is not; listed_option_missing and not_listed as for price.","network: testnet_only when every live payable option is on a test network, else mainnet.","kept: true when the price is as_listed or below_listed and the pay_to is as_listed; false when the price is above_listed or listed_option_missing or the pay_to is different; null when the endpoint gave no payable offer, or the listing states no price or no pay-to address to compare.","asked: the live option the comparison used (the first compared listed option's cheapest match), or the first live option when none could be compared.","Networks are compared as CAIP-2 ids (x402 v1 names are mapped), EVM addresses in lower case, Solana addresses as written, amounts as whole atomic units."],"probe":{"asked":8,"budget_seconds":10800,"chosen":8,"ended":"2026-11-16T06:00:00Z","per_host":100,"started":"2026-11-16T06:00:00Z","user_agent":"Agoranome-inspector/0.1 (+https://github.com/shariar-k/agoranome1; unpaid offer check, sends no payment)"},"rows":[{"category":"web_search","host":"plain.example","listed":[{"amount":"1000","asset":"0x833589fcd6edb6e08f4c7c32d4f71b54bda02913","network":"eip155:8453","pay_to":"0x1111111111111111111111111111111111111111","scheme":"exact"}],"resource":"http://plain.example/search","seen":{"at":"2026-11-16T06:00:00Z","attempts":1,"error":"refused","fair_offer":null,"method":null,"options":[],"sha256":null,"status":null,"where":null,"x402":null},"verdict":{"answer":"declined","asked":null,"kept":null,"network":null,"pay_to":null,"price":null}},{"category":"web_search","host":"down.example","listed":[{"amount":"1000","asset":"0x833589fcd6edb6e08f4c7c32d4f71b54bda02913","network":"eip155:8453","pay_to":"0x1111111111111111111111111111111111111111","scheme":"exact"}],"resource":"https://down.example/search","seen":{"at":"2026-11-16T06:00:00Z","attempts":2,"error":"unreachable","fair_offer":null,"method":null,"options":[],"sha256":null,"status":null,"where":null,"x402":null},"verdict":{"answer":"unreachable","asked":null,"kept":null,"network":null,"pay_to":null,"price":null}},{"category":"web_search","host":"free.example","listed":[{"amount":"1000","asset":"0x833589fcd6edb6e08f4c7c32d4f71b54bda02913","network":"eip155:8453","pay_to":"0x1111111111111111111111111111111111111111","scheme":"exact"}],"resource":"https://free.example/se